Z||000006||DRH||07-11-2001||05:07 PM||||It's all in the camera set up. The before picture is at more of an angle with little or no extra lighting. The after is almost straight from behind with some <B>really</B> bright lighting. Look how the tires and underside of the car are lit up. Also, notice the shadow the car is casting in front of it. The reflectivity of the plate washes out the letters... duh.<P>Now, if we can just get the police to use a very bright flash every time they take a picture this stuff <B>might</B> work.<P>What a rip off...||||reg||13
